  su name chorus request begin stage ob text "TARGET_WORDS: 18-25\nSECTION_ROLE: MEMORY_ANCHOR\nFORMAT: RHYMING_COUPLETS\nRHYME_SCHEME: AABB\nSOURCE TEXT:\n" to name text chorus request be text do
