  su name verse two request begin stage ob text "TARGET_WORDS: 35-45\nSECTION_ROLE: EXPLANATION_EXAMPLES\nFORMAT: RHYMING_COUPLETS\nRHYME_SCHEME: AABB_OR_AABBCC\nPRIOR SEGMENT:\n" to name text verse two request be text do
